#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "The <0>Mithqál Calculator</0> is a free tool designed to help calculate the value of gold and silver in mithqáls, the traditional unit of weight used for <1>Huqúqu'lláh</1> calculations in the Bahá'í Faith."
msgstr "Die <0>Mithqál Sakrekenaar</0> is 'n gratis hulpmiddel wat ontwerp is om die waarde van goud en silwer in mithqáls te help bereken, die tradisionele gewigseenheid wat gebruik word vir <1>Huqúqu'lláh</1> berekeninge in die Bahá'í Geloof."

