#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "The Bahá'í Faith is a world religion founded by Bahá'u'lláh in 19th-century Persia. It teaches the essential oneness of all religions and the unity of humanity. Bahá'ís believe in progressive revelation, meaning that God has sent a series of divine messengers throughout history, including Abraham, Moses, Buddha, Jesus, Muhammad, and most recently Bahá'u'lláh. For more information, please visit <0>bahai.org</0>."
msgstr "Die Bahá'í Geloof is 'n wêreldgodsdiens wat deur Bahá'u'lláh in die 19de-eeuse Persië gestig is. Dit leer die noodsaaklike eenheid van alle godsdienste en die eenheid van die mensdom. Bahá'í's glo in progressiewe openbaring, wat beteken dat God 'n reeks goddelike boodskappers deur die geskiedenis gestuur het, insluitend Abraham, Moses, Boeddha, Jesus, Mohammed, en mees onlangs Bahá'u'lláh. Vir meer inligting, besoek asseblief <0>bahai.org</0>."

